{"id":"770aefc56bf0351b","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-veblen-comparison.md","title":"Veblen 值的比较律","display":"thm-veblen-comparison — Veblen 值的比较律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-veblen-comparison","aliases":["18-thm-veblen-comparison"],"display":"thm-veblen-comparison — Veblen 值的比较律","depends_on":["[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-thm-veblen-monotonicity]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Theorem 3.4.9","source_pages":"37–38","source_pdf_pages":"47–48","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-veblen-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-veblen-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-veblen-comparison — Veblen 值的比较律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"243363d27f588e48\" href=\"?note=243363d27f588e48\" title=\"18-thm-veblen-monotonicity\">18-thm-veblen-monotonicity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 3.4.9"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"37–38"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"47–48"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\beta_1,\\beta_2\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\beta_1,\\beta_2\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a> 的 Veblen 族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)=\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n(\\alpha_1&lt;\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1=\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2))\\lor\n(\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1=\\beta_2)\\lor\n(\\alpha_2&lt;\\alpha_1\\land\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)=\\beta_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)=\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n(\\alpha_1&lt;\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1=\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2))\\lor\n(\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1=\\beta_2)\\lor\n(\\alpha_2&lt;\\alpha_1\\land\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)=\\beta_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)&lt;\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n(\\alpha_1&lt;\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1&lt;\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2))\\lor\n(\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1&lt;\\beta_2)\\lor\n(\\alpha_2&lt;\\alpha_1\\land\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)&lt;\\beta_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)&lt;\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n(\\alpha_1&lt;\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1&lt;\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2))\\lor\n(\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1&lt;\\beta_2)\\lor\n(\\alpha_2&lt;\\alpha_1\\land\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)&lt;\\beta_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已逐项核对 Theorem 3.4.9(A)(B) 与证明。指标相等时由严格递增性；指标不等时由吸收律，将两边改写为同一较低层函数值后比较自变量。本书旧目录没有这个复用比较接口，新增用于序数记号比较与不动点等号反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-veblen-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"243363d27f588e48","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-veblen-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\beta_1,\\beta_2\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\varphi$ 为 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]] 的 Veblen 族。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\beta_1,\\beta_2\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)=\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n(\\alpha_1<\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1=\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2))\\lor\n(\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1=\\beta_2)\\lor\n(\\alpha_2<\\alpha_1\\land\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)=\\beta_2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)<\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n(\\alpha_1<\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1<\\varphi_{\\alpha_2}(\\beta_2))\\lor\n(\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2\\land\\beta_1<\\beta_2)\\lor\n(\\alpha_2<\\alpha_1\\land\\varphi_{\\alpha_1}(\\beta_1)<\\beta_2).","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-veblen-comparison]]"},{"id":"7ce998ba18c1c45a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[